      <h1>Commercial renovation glossary</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;color:var(--gray2);max-width:600px;margin-top:16px">Plain-English definitions for the terms you will encounter when planning a commercial renovation in Toronto and Ontario. Used by tenants, property managers, and business owners who are new to commercial construction.</p>
